# REST Client Requests for Manual UAT
# Supported in: IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code (REST Client), Cursor, and others
# 
# To use: Click the "Send Request" link above each request, or use:
#   IntelliJ: Ctrl+Alt+E (or Cmd+Alt+E on Mac)
#   VS Code:  Ctrl+Alt+R

### Get All Subscription
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subscription

### Get Subscription by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subscription/{subscriptionrootId}

